id=playintegrityfix
name=mblu21 integrity
version=v1.2.0
versionCode=10200
author=Zhafron
description=TrickyStore keystore attestation plus Play Integrity Fork props for the Meizu mBlu 21. Keeps the keybox already on the device and, with auto_keybox=1, fetches one on a schedule from https:// or file:// only, validating the ecdsa and rsa chains before it replaces anything.
